            "body": "they all come from svelte lsp and removing tailwindcss makes no difference and i was wrong typescript is not attached to this buffer\r\nthe problem is svelte returns many unrelated candidates with mini.completion which is so strange to be honest\r\nrecorded a video illustrating the bug\r\nhttps://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/assets/27911493/21ed87dd-f76f-4fd0-aad3-0966c681f147\r\nat the first try to complete <di i get dispatachEvent and all unrelated candidates after typing class and removing i get the right candidates for a html tag\r\n\r\n",
